type: software
title: "ODC Simulation Pipeline: satellite-streak, pixel-loss and sky-brightness simulations for orbital data centers observed by Vera C. Rubin Observatory"
version: v1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-05"            # <- set to the actual release date

# License: must be the SAME as the LICENSE file in the repo AND the Zenodo
# license field. GPL-3.0-or-later is suggested because Step 8 imports rubin_sim
# and Step 10 imports rubin_scheduler (both GPL-3.0). Change if you choose differently.
