    given-names: Nayan
    affiliation: "[The Grainger College of Engineering, Department of Aerospace Engineering, University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign, Urbana, IL, USA],[IAU Centre for the Protection of the Dark and Quiet Sky, France]"
